{"schema_version":"genshin-world-lore-card-v1","lore_id":"inazuma_narukami","name_zh":"鸣神岛","name_en":"Narukami Island","aliases":["鸣神岛","Narukami Island"],"category":"geography","scope":"regional","regions":["Inazuma"],"summary":"鸣神岛是 Inazuma 的一处区域，从入境港 Ritou 延伸至 Mt. Yougou；沿海坐落着 Inazuma City，岛上另有茂密森林与水下遗迹。这里也是 Inazuma Shogunate 的主要统治区域及公共节庆、文化活动的举办地。","canonical_facts":[{"fact_id":"inazuma_narukami_fact_01","text":"鸣神岛是 Inazuma 的一处区域。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"未注明具体时期","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_inazuma_narukami"]},{"fact_id":"inazuma_narukami_fact_02","text":"该区域从入境港 Ritou 延伸至 Mt. Yougou；Grand Narukami Shrine 位于 Mt. Yougou，Inazuma City 则位于岛屿沿海。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"未注明具体时期","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_inazuma_narukami"]},{"fact_id":"inazuma_narukami_fact_03","text":"鸣神岛分布着茂密森林和水下遗迹。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"未注明具体时期","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_inazuma_narukami"]},{"fact_id":"inazuma_narukami_fact_04","text":"鸣神岛是 Inazuma Shogunate 的主要统治区域；证据所述时期，当地依照 Sakoku Decree 实施政策与法律。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"Sakoku Decree 施行时期","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_inazuma_narukami"]},{"fact_id":"inazuma_narukami_fact_05","text":"Inazuma 的公共节庆和文化活动会在鸣神岛举行。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"未注明具体时期","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_inazuma_narukami"]},{"fact_id":"inazuma_narukami_fact_06","text":"来访 Inazuma 的旅人能够见到山上的 Grand Narukami Shrine、Sacred Sakura，以及海岸边的 Inazuma City。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"未注明具体时期","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_inazuma_narukami"]}],"timeline":[],"relationships":[],"in_world_visibility":{"public_summary":"鸣神岛的地理位置、入境港、沿海城市、山上神社及其作为主要统治区域和公共活动举办地的性质，应属于 Inazuma 地区较容易获知的信息；入境旅人也能直接观察到其中若干显著地标。","likely_known_by":["鸣神岛居民","Inazuma Shogunate 官员","经 Ritou 入境的旅人","参与当地节庆和文化活动者"],"unlikely_known_by":["从未到访 Inazuma 且缺乏当地信息者"],"common_